00:01:07.726 --> 00:01:09.697
- [Voiceover] Abby
asks, "As a 24 year old,

00:01:09.697 --> 00:01:11.485
"how can I turn a possible disadvantage

00:01:11.485 --> 00:01:13.416
"like being young, into an advantage

00:01:13.416 --> 00:01:14.904
"as a speaker and a coach?"

00:01:16.423 --> 00:01:18.514
- Abby, this is a great question,

00:01:18.514 --> 00:01:20.059
and first of all, we waited a long time

00:01:20.059 --> 00:01:21.237
to answer this right.

00:01:21.237 --> 00:01:23.595
She's been posting this on
the Gram for awhile, India,

00:01:23.595 --> 00:01:24.357
I'm talking to you?

00:01:24.357 --> 00:01:26.116
- [India] Long time.
- Long time.

00:01:26.116 --> 00:01:27.607
So, first of all, really appreciate

00:01:27.607 --> 00:01:30.167
the hustle and the perseverance.

00:01:30.167 --> 00:01:31.204
Actually, let's interrupt the show

00:01:31.204 --> 00:01:33.052
and tell you how you can ask a question

00:01:33.052 --> 00:01:35.222
on The #AskGaryVee Show.

00:01:36.373 --> 00:01:38.446
Hey, I'm Gary Vaynerchuk,
and you're watching

00:01:38.446 --> 00:01:40.397
The #AskGaryVee Show.

00:01:40.397 --> 00:01:41.799
Tim, that's a great question.

00:01:41.799 --> 00:01:42.773
Paul, that's a great question.

00:01:42.773 --> 00:01:44.237
Matt, this is a great question.

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:48.794
(light music)

00:02:03.375 --> 00:02:06.321
Abby, you know, it's funny.

00:02:06.321 --> 00:02:08.394
I love your hustle and
perseverance so much,

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:11.319
but I'm gonna zing and zang
a little bit on this answer

00:02:11.319 --> 00:02:16.297
because I am really tired of 21, 19,

00:02:16.297 --> 00:02:19.486
22, 24 year olds wanting to be

00:02:19.486 --> 00:02:21.945
speaker and coaches about things

00:02:21.945 --> 00:02:24.810
that they are not able
to speak and coach about

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:26.272
because they don't have the experience.

00:02:26.272 --> 00:02:27.533
You're right, it is a disadvantage.

00:02:27.533 --> 00:02:31.534
It's very hard for me to want to listen,

00:02:31.534 --> 00:02:33.932
or pay you for business advice

00:02:33.932 --> 00:02:35.842
when you've never built a business.

00:02:35.842 --> 00:02:37.629
And by the way, you don't have to be 24,

00:02:37.629 --> 00:02:40.372
you could be 39 and try
to sell business advice,

00:02:40.372 --> 00:02:41.368
when you've never sold a business.

00:02:41.368 --> 00:02:45.289
Now, that's me making a
leap and an assumption

00:02:45.289 --> 00:02:47.341
that that's what you want to talk about.

00:02:47.341 --> 00:02:49.169
If you want to talk about the perspective

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:52.095
of a millennial on how to use social media

00:02:52.095 --> 00:02:54.614
because you are one, cool.

00:02:54.614 --> 00:02:57.459
If you want to talk about
the things you've learned,

00:02:57.459 --> 00:02:59.470
you know, in whatever genre.

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:01.786
If you've been making
music since you were 13,

00:03:01.786 --> 00:03:03.940
and you're 24, that's an 11 year career,

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:06.804
but the truth is you can only talk about,

00:03:06.804 --> 00:03:10.970
and demand and command
attention and respect

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:14.018
around something you've
actually accomplished.

00:03:14.018 --> 00:03:17.755
Just saying that you're
a coach and a speaker

00:03:17.755 --> 00:03:21.515
doesn't mean you are one because
you just said you are one.

00:03:21.515 --> 00:03:25.416
You've got to earn the
credit to be able to do it.

00:03:25.416 --> 00:03:27.629
Now look, do I believe that you can be

00:03:27.629 --> 00:03:29.621
a football coach without playing football?

00:03:29.621 --> 00:03:31.815
Yes, but we've hit on this before.

00:03:31.815 --> 00:03:33.826
When you look at the
coaches that were coaches

00:03:33.826 --> 00:03:36.976
that, you know, didn't play football,

00:03:36.976 --> 00:03:39.049
most of them played college football,

00:03:39.049 --> 00:03:40.288
maybe they didn't get to the pros.

00:03:40.288 --> 00:03:42.990
Most of them, if they
didn't play football,

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:44.330
at least, at bare minimum,

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:46.809
played high school football competitively,

00:03:46.809 --> 00:03:48.414
and then had a father normally

00:03:48.414 --> 00:03:51.889
who was a coach, or was
within the organization

00:03:51.889 --> 00:03:53.716
of a major sports franchise.

00:03:53.716 --> 00:03:56.520
I mean, you've got to put in the work,

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:59.060
and so you know, the reason
there's a disadvantage

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:01.396
of being 24 and getting
people to listen to you

00:04:01.396 --> 00:04:03.590
is cause they're right.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:06.862
Now, there's anomalies, maybe you were 17

00:04:06.862 --> 00:04:09.320
and you built a huge
business and sold it at 21.

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:11.392
The age is not the variable, you know,

00:04:11.392 --> 00:04:13.505
I feel like I did a lot by 24.

00:04:13.505 --> 00:04:14.988
I could walk onto stage and say,

00:04:14.988 --> 00:04:17.243
"Hey guys, in the last 24 months,

00:04:17.243 --> 00:04:19.742
"since I was 22, and I took
over my dad's business,

00:04:19.742 --> 00:04:21.043
"I've taken it in the last 24 months

00:04:21.043 --> 00:04:23.298
"from 3 to 15 million dollars.

00:04:23.298 --> 00:04:24.471
"Here's how I did it."

00:04:25.257 --> 00:04:27.960
That's some credibility,
that's some chops,

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:29.646
but I couldn't have at that point say,

00:04:29.646 --> 00:04:33.019
"Let me talk to you about HR as a leader."

00:04:33.019 --> 00:04:35.518
Only 24 months of that experience,

00:04:35.518 --> 00:04:37.996
only so much value compared
to when I do it now

00:04:37.996 --> 00:04:40.902
of having two decades of doing it.

00:04:40.902 --> 00:04:44.620
So you know, it's a
disadvantage for a purpose,

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:46.347
right, for a reason.

00:04:46.347 --> 00:04:48.500
If you're an anomaly, radical,

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:50.511
but if you're not, you need to respect

00:04:50.511 --> 00:04:52.468
that people are not idiots.

00:04:54.473 --> 00:04:55.916
