00:10:06.681 --> 00:10:09.505
Listen, Google pay per
click is tremendous,

00:10:09.505 --> 00:10:11.211
but I also think that Linkedin ads

00:10:11.211 --> 00:10:13.223
have tremendous upside for you.

00:10:13.223 --> 00:10:16.250
Also, Linkedin creative,
meaning putting out

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:18.932
blog posts on Linkedin, and then having

00:10:18.932 --> 00:10:20.801
a call to action at the bottom

00:10:20.801 --> 00:10:22.630
I think could actually
work for you quite a bit

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:24.479
cause the B to B mentality within Linkedin

00:10:24.479 --> 00:10:26.999
