00:10:34.251 --> 00:10:35.185
on other places where you have

00:10:35.185 --> 00:10:38.030
a little bit of a base to
create some awareness around it.

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.594
I'm a big fan of that.

00:10:39.594 --> 00:10:42.439
I actually think you can get stunningly,

00:10:42.439 --> 00:10:44.572
stunning Hail Mary upside

00:10:44.572 --> 00:10:48.107
