00:10:53.105 --> 00:10:54.893
if you're actually targeting people

00:10:54.893 --> 00:10:58.164
in a business world that
could actually buy this,

00:10:58.164 --> 00:11:00.155
but yeah I would say Google,

00:11:00.155 --> 00:11:02.309
I would say content.

00:11:02.309 --> 00:11:05.681
I would say go and reach
out to any B to B platforms.

00:11:05.681 --> 00:11:08.749
Podcasts, some blogs that
speak to the audience

00:11:08.749 --> 00:11:10.314
