director can be a guest

00:11:13.971 --> 00:11:15.779
contributor, or interviewed on there

00:11:15.779 --> 00:11:17.303
because that exposure I think actually

00:11:17.303 --> 00:11:19.212
can convert for you,
maybe not at the scale

00:11:19.212 --> 00:11:22.341
that you can get from a PPC Google world.

00:11:22.341 --> 00:11:24.414
I also think you can target people

00:11:24.414 --> 00:11:27.808
by their office, you
know by where they work

00:11:27.808 --> 00:11:29.838
on Facebook dark posts
that I think you could get

00:11:29.838 --> 00:11:31.199
some really great results there.

00:11:31.199 --> 00:11:32.906
Especially if you upload
some of the native videos

00:11:32.906 --> 00:11:35.852
that you actually create
in native Facebook form,

00:11:35.852 --> 00:11:37.802
I think you can actually get
some interesting results there.

00:11:37.802 --> 00:11:42.232
So, do I think Google PPC
still wins the day for you?

00:11:42.232 --> 00:11:43.979
I think it's clearly gonna
be one of the three winners.

00:11:43.979 --> 00:11:46.925
